      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 294,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: snake\n---\n# Welcome to Nova Visual Scripting\n\nThis project was created from the **snake** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.",
